"Haan man bhari hai thora sa\nYe yaadein bhi kaatti hain\nChahte to hain kaafi kuchh karna        \nPar himmat uski abhi bhi nahi aa rhi hai\n\nHaan bura to zaroor lgta hoga\nAise lgta nahi to dikkat thi\nYaadein gam banke ubhar rhin hain       \nYani ye safar zaroor mazdar rha hoga    \n\nChahre pe muskaan la kar\nAankhon ke kajal ko bachakar\nAane wale aasuon se\nChaliye shuru krte hain yaadon ka safar \n\nKuchh naye honge, kuchh purane\nKuchh 24 ke kuchh 14 ke mehman hain        \n\nWo hindi ki classes\nLalita ma'am jo leti thin\nEVS aur zindagi ka gyaan\nJo Manisha ma'am detin thin\n\nEnglish ki to ky baat thi\nKabhi Madhuri Ma'am\nYa Kanchan ma'am\nKabhi ma'am Kamini thin\n\nUs padhane ke andaaz ko\nBhool kaise sakte hain\nMandal sir ki haath pe lali\nPair ko bhool kaise sakte hain\n\nPahli baar to tab roye honge\nJab primary section chhorna tha\nManisha ma'am ke saath to har saal tha\nAansu the ki rukte hi nahi\n\nFir jab sst mili aur mili maths ki abcd\nYe x to hamesha ignore hoti thi\nYa hota shayad hoga\nPar Aaj iski ahamiyat pata chali thi\n\nhistory civics geo sab the\nkavita ma'am cinematic kaviyatri thin\nbhargav sar varun bankar water cycle late the\nwahin prabhat sir sst me science ka prabhat laate the\n\nAsli safar to ye online ka tha\nRK Singh sir ke sab gentle bachche\nSukesh sir to maze lete the\nKabhi china, to kabhi korea chhor aate the\nYa kabhi sst ke beech, hamari physics ka maze uthate the\n\nJab ax + b = 0 dekha tha\nLagta tha ye ky ajooba hai\nAaj kaash yahi dekhne ko mile\nTo mandir mazjit church har jagah jaaun\n\nwo bhi smjh aa gaya tha\njab rana sir se trigo mila\naur bharat sinha sir me similarity\n\nBare to ho gye hain hum sabhi\nKhair, Nutan ma'am ki bio yaad hai?\nYa Sanjay Suman Sir ki science?\nKhair, Ganesh sir ka kala chashma to yaad hi hoga.\n\nenglish ki jyoti to tab jali thi\ntab jyoti ma'am ne beehive khulwaya tha\nkaushal sir ne homophones\naur tense structures ko dimag me baithaya tha\n\nHindi English Chemistry\nIs trimur