n\nLibrary me books nahi milte\nShashi sir ko sab the dhundhte\nYa fir electronics ke Kamalesh sir\nWE with AI, and Sajal Sir\n\nApni jaati se hatke padhate the\nRoz bike pe munger se aate the\nHamesha mast rhte the, muskurate the\nHar bachche ko special feel karwate the\nKabhi ham sab unhe gussa dilate the\nPar jo bhi kaho, Navneet sir maths me exception banke aate the\n\nHamare VP sir bhi kuchh kam nahi hain\nCS padhate aisa, unke aage kisi me dam nahi hai\nSir ka loop chalana hamesha yaad rahega\nAur wo python ka essence, dil me sada bahega\n\nYa Mahto sir ki random SST class\nWo motivational speeches, wo shabdon ka ullaas\n\nAap wo batch hain jinhone 3 kv dekhe hain\n\nPaswan sir ki surprise entry\nYa unka emotional support\nThori masti, thori padhai\nYa ho class 1 ki assembly ka josh\n\nYa ho Meena sir ke events and fun\nJo bhi kaho, Principal to AC, unme tha to dam\nAapko bachane ke liye khud sah lete the\nFun Day bhi weekly de diya karte the\n\nSantosh Choudhary Sir ki to baat hi nirali hai\nSchool trip ya foundation day\nHar jagah hariyali hai\nDiscipline aur co-curricular\nNYP ya RBVP, sabka ek alag color\n\nKabhi ye sab bandhan lgte honge\nAaj inme bandhne ka man karta hai\n\nKoi na, bharat ka swarnim gaurav\nAap ab wapas laayenge\nAnkhiyon se water aayein hon shayad\nNahi aaye to wo bhi hum laayenge\n\nAb jaane ka man to nhi kr rha hoga\nYaadein jo nayi bana nahi paayenge\nJo bani hain unhe yaad krte hain\nAaiye seniors, pura muskurate hain"